OL,3,GNEWSANew Beatles attraction will wow
OL,4,Afans, guide says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Beatles tour guide says a major new
OL,7,Fattraction could bring even more
OL,8,Fvisitors to the city as interest in the
OL,9,Fband continues to grow.
OL,11,FThe Beatles Story is due to relocate to
OL,12,Fthe former St Johns Market site in
OL,13,FLiverpool in 2028, alongside a new
OL,14,FYellow Submarine experience at St Johns
OL,15,FBeacon.
OL,17,FThe plans have been welcomed by tourism
OL,18,Fleaders, who expect the expanded
OL,19,Fattraction to draw large numbers of
OL,20,Fvisitors from around the world.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
